---
/**
 * FTC Endorsement Guides (16 CFR Part 255) require this near the links it
 * covers, not buried in a footer. Placed once per page, at the top, by Base
 * layout — a single disclosure covering every affiliate link on the page is
 * sufficient as long as it's clearly visible and stays that way while
 * scrolling. Only render this on pages that actually have affiliate links
 * (Base.astro's `hasAffiliateLinks` prop) — a disclosure on a page with
 * nothing to disclose dilutes the ones that matter.
 */
---

<p class="affiliate-disclosure">
  Some links on this page are affiliate links — we may earn a commission if you
  buy through them, at no extra cost to you. This never affects which products or
  contractors we mention, or the specs we report.
</p>
